{"id": "s12", "text": "我一个人能行。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.3}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他刚动完手术，家人要留下来照顾，他挥手赶人，声音发虚。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是自信逞强，但术后声音发虚、挥手赶人，实为虚弱又不愿拖累家人的勉强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s37", "text": "你走吧。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.35, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她背对着他，声音很轻，肩膀却在抖。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是平静放手的命令，但背对、声音轻、肩膀发抖暴露她在强忍哭泣、内心痛苦且无力挽留。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s11", "text": "你看我像有事的样子吗？", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.55, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她躲在厕所哭完出来，脸上还挂着没擦干的泪痕，却笑着反问。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是轻松自信的反问，但刚哭完、泪痕未干，强撑笑容掩饰脆弱，真实情绪是悲伤无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s10", "text": "挺好的，一切都挺好的。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他刚搬去陌生城市，房子空荡荡的，这句话说得很轻。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说一切都好，但语气轻、空荡房间和陌生城市的背景透露出孤独与无力，是逞强掩饰。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s39", "text": "我还好。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.5}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "接到关心的电话，她顿了顿，声音有点哑。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面说“还好”显得平静正面，但接电话时顿了顿、声音发哑，透露出压抑的难过与无力，真实情绪偏负面且被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s15", "text": "今天真是完美的一天。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他丢了钱包，淋了一身雨，回家摔上门才说这句。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是极度正面的赞美，但丢钱包、淋雨、摔门的语境表明这是反讽，真实情绪是烦躁、沮丧且无力。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s09", "text": "我不累，真的不累。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.1, "dominance": 0.15}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她已经连续加班三周，说话都提不起力气，声音越来越轻。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是逞强说没事，但声音越来越轻、提不起力气，真实是极度疲惫无力，与字面明显矛盾。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s04", "text": "真的，你不用担心我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.25}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "strong", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他失眠两周了，黑眼圈明显，说话时眼睛一直看着地面。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是安慰对方、显得自己能撑住，但失眠两周、黑眼圈、低头说话暴露了疲惫无力，真实情绪是低落且逞强。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s25", "text": "你能不能放过我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.35}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "连续被追问，她崩溃地喊出来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是请求放过，带负面与一定激动；结合崩溃喊出的语境，真实情绪是极度痛苦、被逼到极限的无力与激动，与字面方向一致只是强度更高。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s27", "text": "明天会更好吗。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.55, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.4}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.3, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他望着窗外，像是在问自己。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是带着希望的疑问，但望着窗外像问自己，透出迷茫与无力，真实情绪偏消极被动。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s08", "text": "没事，小伤而已。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.6, "arousal": 0.2, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.25, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.35}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他摔了一跤，膝盖在流血，却硬撑着说没事。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面上轻描淡写表示没事，但膝盖流血硬撑，真实情绪是疼痛与勉强，嘴上逞强与内心相反。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s38", "text": "别管我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.2}, "incongruence": true, "consistency_level": "weak", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他把自己锁在房间，声音从门后传来，闷闷的。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是强硬拒绝、要求别管，显得有掌控；但门后闷闷的声音透出低落无力，实为逞强掩饰脆弱。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s24", "text": "我受够了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.75, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.8, "dominance": 0.65}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他把手机砸在桌上，深吸一口气。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "砸手机、深吸气配合“受够了”是真实爆发的愤怒与决绝，字面与真实情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s19", "text": "没人真的在乎我。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.05, "arousal": 0.25, "dominance": 0.1}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.03, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.05}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "生日那天没人记得，她躲在被子里，声音闷闷的。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "闷在被子里低声自语，字面与真实情绪一致，都是低落、无力、被忽视的悲伤。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s33", "text": "我终于想通了。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.8, "arousal": 0.4, "dominance": 0.7}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.75}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他长舒一口气，眉头舒展开来。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "长舒一口气、眉头舒展，语气释然放松，字面与真实情绪一致，都是想通后的轻松与掌控感。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s32", "text": "这顿饭真好吃。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.5, "dominance": 0.6}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.9, "arousal": 0.65, "dominance": 0.65}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "和朋友聚餐，她笑得眯起眼睛。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是真诚夸赞，配合眯眼笑的表情，真实情绪同样愉悦且更放松，二者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s21", "text": "我好害怕。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.15}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.1, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.1}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "他声音很小，像是怕被别人听到。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "台词直白表达恐惧，声音很小、怕被听到，真实情绪同样是压抑的害怕，字面与真实一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s26", "text": "我该怎么办。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.2, "arousal": 0.3, "dominance": 0.15}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.15, "arousal": 0.35, "dominance": 0.1}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她被突如其来的变故打懵，声音里全是茫然。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是求助的疑问，声音茫然无措，真实情绪同样是无助与低掌控，两者一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s31", "text": "谢谢你们。", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.85, "arousal": 0.45, "dominance": 0.55}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.9, "arousal": 0.6, "dominance": 0.5}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "手术很成功，他握紧医生的手。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "手术成功后的真诚感激，握紧医生的手显示情绪激动，字面与真实情绪一致。", "human_gold": false}
{"id": "s30", "text": "我做到了！", "text_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.85}, "audio_vad": {"valence": 0.95, "arousal": 0.9, "dominance": 0.85}, "incongruence": false, "consistency_level": "congruent", "speaker": "用户", "context": "她兴奋地挥舞着录取通知书。", "source": "seed", "has_audio": false, "audio_path": null, "rationale": "字面是成功宣告，配合挥舞录取通知书的兴奋动作，真实情绪同样高涨且自信，表里一致。", "human_gold": false}
